{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"欅のねるちゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/13/1457676/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色が白くてちっちゃくて\n可愛かった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この時以来欅ちゃんには\n会ってないな〜(｡･o･｡)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度こそ、みんなに自分から\n声かけられるようにしなきゃ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見逃しちゃったけど(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステ２曲披露お疲れ様でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日、数日前ような\n猛暑ではなくてクーラー付けなくても\n過ごせる気温でしたね(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しでも過ごしやすいと\nその日1日は少しハッピーになる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな小さい幸せを\n毎日感じながら過ごしていたいな( ◦˙ ˙◦ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/13/1457676/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thアンダー１列に整列だよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれが思い思いのピースとポーズ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまの前で手揃えてるところとか\n真洋が腕あげてるとか\n琴子のすんってしてるところとか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それぞれの個性が垣間見える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装の色がそれぞれが少しずつ違うから\nグラデーションみたいになってて\n綺麗。色合い素敵！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この写真見るとなんか夏だな〜って思う(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「だいだらぼっち」RADWIMPSさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の時から聞いてる曲。\nそして、苦しい時辛い時に\n必ず思い出して、思わず口ずさんでしまう。\n聞いたり歌ったりすると\n元気をもらえるんだ。\n歌詞を一語一句間違えないくらい\n覚えてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/08/13/1457676/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハルジオンみると思い出すのは\n今年の春の事と、\nやっぱりみんなと同じあの子。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元気かな(> <)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日からは仙台！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"牛タン、蔵王、笹かま、ずんだ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山美味しいものがあって\n私は幸せです(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！また見つけた小さな幸せ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}